        <mxCell id="scope" value="COVERAGE&#10;Channels: NextGen Web / POS terminals / LINE / iOS / Android / CSP&#10;Checkout: app / business / data / EOM adapter / job scaffold&#10;Fulfillment: app / data / event / job&#10;Context: cart / product / taxation / order / CSP&#10;Cloud: Istio / EKS / databases / Kafka / CDC / delivery / operations&#10;Channel list is user-confirmed; exact channel adapters remain unverified." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#E8F1FF;strokeColor=#6286B5;fontColor=#20334B;fontSize=19;spacing=12;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
