        <mxCell id="unknown" value="CONFIRM WITH PLATFORM / IDENTITY TEAM&#10;CDN product, origin, cache policy and invalidation&#10;DNS, WAF, external load balancer and TLS termination topology&#10;Additional API-management layer ahead of Istio&#10;Identity issuer, JWKS/audience rules, token TTL and refresh behavior&#10;Effective mesh authentication / mTLS and route exposure&#10;Central log sink, dashboards and retention&#10;Node autoscaler, replica placement, failover and disaster recovery&#10;Shared Helm rendering and complete pipeline internals" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#FFF8E8;strokeColor=#C79738;fontColor=#20334B;fontSize=19;spacing=12;arcSize=10;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
